==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|carpentrie}}, from {{der|en|xno|carpenterie}}, from {{der|en|ONF.|-}} (compare {{cog|fr|charpenterie}}). See [[carpenter]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The trade of cutting and joining [[timber]] in order to construct [[building]]s or other structures; [[woodworking]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[carpenter]]'s [[workshop]].
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The work and objects produced by a carpenter.{{attn|en|This current definition is a copyright violation and was aparently taken from Microsoft's Encarta, see [[Special:Diff/60964878]]}}
#: {{ux|en|Fine '''carpentry''' for sale.}}

